---
/** Control Hub: Control Access, Usage, and Subscriptions */
---

<section class="sec sec--white">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head rv">
      <h2 class="h2">Control Access, Usage, <em class="s">and Subscriptions</em></h2>
      <p class="lede">Decide which customers can buy each plan, see how every plan is used, and change service for one line or a whole fleet.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cards rv">
      <article class="card">
        <div class="viz mk" aria-hidden="true">
          <table class="mx">
            <thead><tr><th>Plan</th><th>Distributor</th><th>Enterprise</th><th>Retail</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>Watch 1 GB</td><td><i class="tgl on"></i></td><td><i class="tgl"></i></td><td><i class="tgl on"></i></td></tr>
              <tr><td>Tracker 50 MB</td><td><i class="tgl on"></i></td><td><i class="tgl on"></i></td><td><i class="tgl"></i></td></tr>
              <tr><td>Camera 10 GB</td><td><i class="tgl on"></i></td><td><i class="tgl on"></i></td><td><i class="tgl"></i></td></tr>
              <tr><td>Business 5 GB</td><td><i class="tgl"></i></td><td><i class="tgl on"></i></td><td><i class="tgl on"></i></td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
          <div class="esim-f"><span>catalog per customer</span><b>only enabled plans show</b></div>
        </div>
        <h3>Plan Access Control</h3>
        <p>Publish each plan only to the resellers and customers who should see it. Enterprise and retail customers each get their own catalog, with your pricing and none of the operator detail.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <div class="viz mk" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="box-h" style="margin-bottom:10px"><small>Data used &middot; this cycle</small><span class="seg"><span class="on">Device</span><span>Plan</span><span>Reseller</span></span></div>
          <div class="ub">
            <div><span>Wearables</span><span class="t"><i style="width:64%"></i></span><em>64%</em></div>
            <div><span>Telematics</span><span class="t"><i style="width:38%"></i></span><em>38%</em></div>
            <div><span>Cameras</span><span class="t"><i style="width:91%"></i></span><em>91%</em></div>
            <div><span>Smartphones</span><span class="t"><i style="width:52%"></i></span><em>52%</em></div>
          </div>
          <div class="alert"><i>!</i><div><b>212 camera lines above 90%</b><span>step-up rule ready</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <h3>Usage Across Plans and Devices</h3>
        <p>Track data, voice, and SMS usage by plan, device type, reseller, and customer, with alerts before a line runs out of allowance.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <div class="viz mk" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="bulk">
            <div class="sel"><span><b>1,204 lines</b> selected</span><span class="st st--acc">DE trackers</span></div>
            <div class="acts"><span>Activate</span><span>Suspend</span><span class="on">Change plan</span></div>
            <div class="sel"><span>New plan</span><b>Tracker 100 MB</b></div>
            <div class="prog"><i></i></div>
            <div class="esim-f" style="margin-top:0"><span>dashboard or API</span><b>868 of 1,204 done</b></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Subscription Management at Scale</h3>
        <p>Activate, suspend, and change plans for a single line or an entire fleet, from the dashboard or through the API.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
